#: ../../../reference/accessibility/dbus/index.md:13
msgid ""
"AT-SPI (Assistive Technology Service Provider Interface) is the core of an "
"accessibility stack for Ubuntu Desktop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/dbus/index.md:15
msgid ""
"It provides a list of methods, signals, and properties provided by a D-Bus "
"service, in an XML format. These methods define what operations an assistive "
"technology can perform or request on UI elements."
msgstr ""
